{"availability":"available","full":"GeiserX/paperless-telegram-bot","name":"paperless-telegram-bot","description":"Manage Paperless-NGX documents entirely through Telegram - upload, search, tag, and organize","category":"Other","language":"Python","stars":13,"forks":2,"created":"2026-02-13T20:39:49Z","updated":"2026-10-07T02:00:22Z","license":"GPL-3.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://geiserx.github.io/paperless-telegram-bot/","topics":["datahoarder","digital-archive","docker","document-archiving","document-management","document-scanner","document-search","full-text-search","homelab","ocr","paperless","paperless-bot","paperless-client","paperless-ngx","python-telegram-bot","receipt-management","search","self-hosted","telegram-bot","upload"],"demo":"https://geiserx.github.io/paperless-telegram-bot/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-07T02:54:31.441Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-07T02:54:31.441Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-07T02:54:31.441Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-07T02:54:31.441Z","stars":13,"forks":2}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Your Paperless-ngx archive, run from Telegram.","paperless-telegram-bot is a Telegram bot for Paperless-ngx, run in Docker. Send a photo or a file from your phone and it lands in your archive; then tag it, file it, search it and get it back, all from the chat. The bot polls Telegram and talks to Paperless over its API, so it needs no public URL, no open port and no VPN on the phone, and Paperless can stay on your LAN."],"features":["Send a photo or any file up to 20 MB (Telegram's limit for bots) and it is uploaded to Paperless; the reply changes to the document's title once Paperless has finished processing it.","Tag it, pick the correspondent and the document type from inline keyboards right after the upload, or create a new tag, correspondent or type without leaving the chat.","A file Paperless already has is not stored twice: the bot names the existing document and offers it for download.","Type any text to search the archive; results come in pages, each with a Download button. /search does the same.","/inbox lists what still carries the inbox tag; Reviewed clears it with one tap, and so does Done after an upload."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/GeiserX/paperless-telegram-bot/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"77e92c68242018476afee021612bc973ef9124e3cc021cc258490ce84fb400d4","extractedAt":"2026-10-07T02:54:31.598Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-07T02:54:31.598Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Your Paperless-ngx archive, run from Telegram.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/GeiserX/paperless-telegram-bot/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"77e92c68242018476afee021612bc973ef9124e3cc021cc258490ce84fb400d4","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/GeiserX/paperless-telegram-bot/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-07T02:54:31.598Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-07T02:00:22Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/GeiserX/paperless-telegram-bot/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-07T02:54:31.598Z","hash":"77e92c68242018476afee021612bc973ef9124e3cc021cc258490ce84fb400d4","originalBytes":5417,"storedBytes":5417,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["paperless","telegram","bot","token","docker","file","run","start","api","archive","paperless-telegram-bot","search","tag","what","back","document","get","getting","inbox","list","name","paperless-ngx","started","type","url","user","works","address","after","any","bots","chat.","compose","correspondent","does","download","every","first","like","looks","one","open","phone","photo","profile","send","source","step","upload","when","which","without","working","access","allow","allowed","already","always","amd64","arm64.","auth","bash","below","botfather","both","browser.","button.","carries","cause","changes","chat","clears","click","code","come","command","commands","configuration","containe